{"id":"n65730-1-11","stage":5,"title":"시커멓다 · 黝黑","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65730-1-11-1","ko":"너 이번 여름에 해수욕장에 다녀왔지? 재미있었어?","zh":"你这次夏天去海滨浴场玩过了对吧？玩得开心吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"여름에","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름에","audio":"/audio/4d8be9bc13ecd85fb424.mp3"}},{"text":"해수욕장에","meaning":"海水浴场","explanation":"해수욕장：海水浴场；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"해수욕장","audio":"/audio/978be6d2cb30dc094a3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85716","senseId":"1","lemma":"해수욕장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해수욕장에","audio":"/audio/49eb8e0ed2ac47ae035d.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀왔지?","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀왔지","audio":"/audio/3099682b993c81c64ba7.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있었어?","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있었어","audio":"/audio/3fa0cdeed202a157bbd3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"978be6d2cb30dc09","term":"해수욕장","zh":"海水浴场","audio":"/audio/978be6d2cb30dc094a3b.mp3","entryId":"85716","definition":"具备能让人们在海水中游泳玩耍的设施的海滩。","pronunciation":["해ː수욕짱"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/244130a3047046f1a171.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65730-1-11-2","ko":"응. 재미있었어. 밖에서 너무 많이 놀았더니 햇볕에 타서 얼굴이 시커멓게 됐어.","zh":"嗯，很开心。因为在外面玩得太多了，被太阳晒得脸都黑掉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있었어.","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있었어","audio":"/audio/3fa0cdeed202a157bbd3.mp3"}},{"text":"밖에서","meaning":"外，外边","explanation":"밖：外，外边；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"1","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에서","audio":"/audio/b5f2e1d501f86ee19da3.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"놀았더니","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀았더니","audio":"/audio/9d2810a0d3b195162b60.mp3"}},{"text":"햇볕에","meaning":"阳光，日光","explanation":"햇볕：阳光，日光；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"햇볕","audio":"/audio/3c6db828ad997dd4ee90.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72475","senseId":"1","lemma":"햇볕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"햇볕에","audio":"/audio/1557c1c1dfd2d68ab427.mp3"}},{"text":"타서","meaning":"晒黑","explanation":"타다：晒黑；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91122","senseId":"2","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타서","audio":"/audio/d9fb028e8fb01eef42af.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"시커멓게","meaning":"黝黑，漆黑","explanation":"시커멓다：黝黑，漆黑；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"시커멓다","audio":"/audio/92b7c6331ef8fa22b756.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65730","senseId":"1","lemma":"시커멓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시커멓게","audio":"/audio/1d0b4356522f0d5c88cf.mp3"}},{"text":"됐어.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐어","audio":"/audio/9b5be22a79f473c72762.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"越过线或界限的那边。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pr